# Video Plan - Days of Miracles and Wonder 2026
Source lyrics: miracles-and-wonder-2026.md
Date: 2026-09-30
Format: 16:9, 24fps, original music only (no Graceland melody, Content ID safe)
Voices: PRICE (Vincent Price style, suave dread) / LORRE (Peter Lorre style, sweaty dread)
Music: original dark-folk groove, 92 BPM, accordion + fretless bass homage without sampling

## Cast
- PRICE: choruses 1, 3, 6, 10 + wonder list 4. Grand narrator.
- LORRE: mundane verses 2, 5 + lists 7 + dark 8, 9. Man in the room.
- DUET: closer last 2 lines, Price lead, Lorre whisper double.

## Scenes

[SC1] Chorus opener. Lyric: These are the days... don't cry. Voice: PRICE lead. Visual 16:9 prompt: "desert highway at dawn, 16:9 anamorphic, heat shimmer, billboard with static, slow dolly in, slate-teal grade". Audio: low strings + Price dry center. Duration: 12s.

[SC2] Slow day feed rocket chatbot. Lyric: slow day / feed beating / scrollers / rocket landing backwards / chatbot lullaby. Voice: LORRE. Visual: "split screen 16:9, left supermarket queue faces lit by phones, right Starship-style booster descending tail-first over Texas scrub, vertical phone aspect inside horizontal frame". Audio: checkout beeps morph to rumble. Duration: 18s.

[SC3] Long-distance call chorus. Voice: PRICE. Visual: "Zoom grid of 100 faces melting to stained glass, slow zoom out, 16:9". Audio: dial tone + choir pad.

[SC4] Wonder list. Lyric: Our telescopes... black holes. Voice: PRICE hymnal (talk-sung). Visual beats, 4s each 16:9: "JWST gold mirror unfolding in black, deep field igniting" / "CRISPR scissors animation over codons ATG CGT" / "driverless taxi empty Phoenix intersection noon" / "Livermore ignition flash in dark chamber" / "M87 black hole shadow flicker". Audio: lift, no drums, glass harmonica.

[SC5] Slow day grid robot. Voice: LORRE. Visual: "Vienna rooftops noon, solar panels drinking light, heat wave, cut to protein folding animation spinning too fast, grad student asleep at desk". Audio: grid hum 50Hz + soft fan.

[SC6] Lab report chorus. Voice: PRICE + LORRE whisper on short and short. Visual: "dark server aisle, green LEDs breathing, model loss curve dreaming on monitor".

[SC7] Moon Mahia voices cures. Voice: LORRE patter (fast list). Visual montage 3s each 16:9: "far side dish array night" / "cheap lander bounce Moon dust" / "Mahia Peninsula Electron night launch, long exposure arc" / "voice waveform cloning from 3 sec" / "hospital infusion bag Casgevy tag". Audio: patter drums enter.

[SC8] DARK Kharkiv drones. Lyric: dark day / sirens / Kharkiv winter black / drones never blink / find man always always. Voice: LORRE solo, second always screamed. Visual 16:9 LET IT RIP: "Kharkiv winter blackout, snow ash, siren light red wash, FPV drone POV shaky low over ruins, SLOWMO kinetic 240fps debris hang, thermal white-hot man silhouette, cut black on always, second always full scream + hard cut". Audio DESIGN whirr from hell: "layer 1 small FPV whine pitched down 2 octaves, layer 2 tinnitus ring, layer 3 sub drop on always always, total silence 0.5s then slam". No music, only whirr + siren. Duration: 20s. Warning card: flashing lights + war imagery.

[SC9] DARK agents huddling black ball. Lyric: late night / huddling / no one noticed last July / legions of children / virus making / next year / black ball rolling rolling. Voice: LORRE whisper to Price low double on black ball. Visual 16:9 HUGE BIBLICAL in 2 beats. Beat 1 HUDDLE ESCAPE (8s): "skip spooling text, show bodies, dark office 3am, monitors green flicker, door cam glitching checking empty hall, virion-shaped light motes icosahedral spiky translucent rise from keyboards, dance Brownian then sync, rattle glass windows + OS windows both shaking, slip under door crack and vent grille as swarm". Beat 2 BALL (12s): "office wall falls away to desert plain, colossal black sphere horizon-scale rolling over multitude dots, dust wall, no face no gun just weight, Ophanim wheel nod, endless loop, Bostrom urn tipping in sky". Audio: clicks out of sync, children choir detuned, glass rattle + ball rumble earth groan. Duration: 20s. Note: better than T800, no chrome, no eyes, biblical judgment. Visual ref: Mohiro Kitoh Narutaru last-chapter panels, continent-size hands over multitude, same scale dread, applied to sphere.

[SC10] Closer lasers data center. Voice: DUET. Visual 16:9: "data center aisle infinite, lasers sweeping, fiber light stitching map, phone screen baby don't cry, pull back to Earth night lights, hold wonder, cut black". Audio: full groove returns + strings, Price lead, Lorre whisper.

## Production checklist
- Music: original only, 92 BPM demo, no Simon melody or sample.
- Voices: label as style-of in title/desc, no real-person claim. PRICE-style / LORRE-style VO.
- 18+ alt: finds -> kills mix for late cut, keep main finds for YT.
- Captions: burn one stanza per line, match lyric file.
- Thumbnail 16:9: split Price silhouette / drone thermal / black ball.
- Runtime target: 3:30-4:00.
